# sha256 pins of the ZiSK proving-key tarballs that zisk-prepare-keys fetches
# from https://storage.googleapis.com/zisk-setup for the pinned ZISK_VERSION.
#
# Polygon publishes only md5 sidecars for these tarballs (plus a .hash file
# for the STARK key). The fetch step verifies the md5 sidecar AND the pin
# below; a pin that reads PENDING is accepted only with
# ZISK_KEYS_ALLOW_UNPINNED=1, in which case the step prints the digest it
# observed so it can be recorded here and reviewed.
#
# Format: <sha256 or PENDING>  <tarball file name>

# Source: the bucket's zisk-provingkey-1.2.0-alpha.hash sidecar, read on
# 2026-09-08. Not yet confirmed against a download by this repository.
8a3874e32de9f44e999ff91f06df618efe44ba0606a7c5c592e3fe59feb58e76  zisk-provingkey-1.2.0-alpha.tar.gz

# 21.9 GB; no sha256 sidecar exists in the bucket. Record from the first
# verified download.
PENDING  zisk-provingkey-plonk-1.2.0-alpha.tar.gz
